  tooltip: 'Nucleophile Nu:⁻',
  body: 'Nu attacks along the line exactly 180° opposite the C–X bond — backside attack. Only that direction overlaps with the empty σ* orbital of C–X, which is why S_N2 always inverts configuration.'
});

